    "body": "Weird, not sure if related, but I got this problem too.\n\nIf I run: `/opt/homebrew/bin/starship prompt --terminal-width=214 --status=0 --pipestatus=0 --keymap=insert --cmd-duration=44999 --jobs=0` it works fine and returns: `in 44s999ms`\n\nNow, with 45000, it doesn't work, and I can only CTRL+C to return.\n`/opt/homebrew/bin/starship prompt --terminal-width=214 --status=0 --pipestatus=0 --keymap=insert --cmd-duration=45000 --jobs=0`\n\nthere's no strace on mac, I'm blind here.",
